An earthquake occurred in
the southern region of Hokkaido.
Please prepare for strong tremors. (JMA)"

00:11:53.250 --> 00:11:56.620
That was a big earthquake just now...

00:11:56.620 --> 00:11:57.910
--That must've been the biggest one
I've ever felt.

