00:13:05.250 --> 00:13:06.290
--Oh, no!
--A blackout?

00:13:06.290 --> 00:13:07.000
--"If you felt a strong quake in your area,
please be careful and ensure your own safety.

00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:08.500
--The traffic lights are dead.
--"If you felt a strong quake in your area,
please be careful and ensure your own safety.

