We just received more information.

00:13:18.620 --> 00:13:21.580
There's a widespread power outage in Hokkaido.

00:13:21.580 --> 00:13:24.290
What? Widespread? So, it's all of Hokkaido?!

00:13:24.290 --> 00:13:26.620
For us Hokkaidoans,
Hokkaido is the world itself!

00:13:26.620 --> 00:13:29.160
If it's all dark, it's the end of the world!

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:32.870
