what's happening with this broadcast?

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:35.910
"We run on our own power,
so it won't affect the broadcast."

00:13:35.910 --> 00:13:41.410
Um... Moiwayama Radio runs on its own power,
so it won't affect any of our broadcasts.

00:13:41.410 --> 00:13:46.120
So even if Hokkaido is all dark,
this broadcast still reaches everyone.

00:13:46.120 --> 00:13:48.000
